00:04:46,153 --> 00:04:52,153
If you come to me at this moment your minutes will become hours your
hours will become days and your days will become a lifetime.

2
00:09:32,307 --> 00:09:38,307
Ashes and Snow is a documentary, drama film directed by Gregory Colbert.

3
00:14:18,461 --> 00:14:24,461
Ashes and Snow, a film by Gregory Colbert, uses both still and movie cameras to
explore extraordinary interactions between humans and animals.

4
00:19:04,615 --> 00:19:10,615
The 60-minute feature is a poetic narrative rather than a documentary.

5
00:23:50,769 --> 00:23:56,769
It aims to lift the natural and artificial barriers between humans and other
species, dissolving the distance that exists between them.

6
00:28:36,923 --> 00:28:42,923
Narrator (voice), played by Laurence Fishburne.

7
00:33:23,076 --> 00:33:29,076
Ashes and Snow by Canadian artist Gregory Colbert is an installation of photographic artworks, films, and a novel in
letters that travels in the Nomadic Museum, a temporary structure built exclusively to house the exhibition.

8
00:38:09,230 --> 00:38:15,230
The work explores the shared poetic sensibilities of human beings and animals.

9
00:42:55,384 --> 00:43:01,384
Ashes and Snow has traveled to Venice, New York City,
Santa Monica, Tokyo, and Mexico City.

10
00:47:41,538 --> 00:47:47,538
To date, Ashes and Snow has attracted more than 10 million visitors, making it
the most attended exhibition by a living artist in history.

11
00:52:27,692 --> 00:52:33,692
The film explores themes of elephant, photographer, art, animals.

12
00:57:13,846 --> 00:57:19,846
The tone is emotional.
